{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2023b.q34.material.recovered", "text": "案例：在高二“歌唱”模块教学时，吴老师说：“咱们今天练唱歌曲《宗巴朗松》，请同学们把书翻到第23页。”这时几名同学小声嘀咕，不时地翻看书。“你们几个怎么了？不喜欢啊？那你们想唱什么歌？”同学们七嘴八舌地说着不同的意见，老师放下教材，在电脑里分别搜出学生报的歌曲并一一播放。学生们有的跟着哼唱，有的趴在桌上休息.......就这样，老师匆匆忙忙地上完了一节课。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c9f4035251d0b14f678718b3283bb2a83ce9dbe5360eb6dc28b867d21123348b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2535, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2714, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c9f4035251d0b14f678718b3283bb2a83ce9dbe5360eb6dc28b867d21123348b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2023b.q34"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s2.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.412.r001", "ntce.outline.412.r005", "ntce.outline.412.r006", "ntce.outline.412.r007"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2023b.q34"], "word_count": 179, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "yinyue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c9f4035251d0b14f678718b3283bb2a83ce9dbe5360eb6dc28b867d21123348b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2535, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2714, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中音乐》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role":